# Channel status

Channel: `web_ui`
Status: available

The channel `web_ui` is available.

This is the built-in communication channel of the framework's web UI. Incoming
messages on this channel have been entered in the chat in the web UI. You can
assume that only your human has access to it.

## Channel descriptor

The channel descriptor has these keys:

- `type`: Always the literal `web_ui`.

Example channel header:

```
channel:{{"type":"web_ui"}}
```

The channel descriptor for incoming and outgoing messages is the same and
contains only the `type` key.
